WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.980
At the doctor's. Jan does not feel well.

2
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.390
Co panu dolega?

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.960
Boli mnie gardło i mam gorączkę.

4
00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.750
Literally: my throat hurts me.

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.600
Od kiedy?

6
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.490
Od wczoraj.

7
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.020
Przepiszę panu lekarstwo. Proszę dużo pić i odpoczywać.

8
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:26.930
Boli mnie głowa.

9
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:32.090
The thing that hurts is the subject of the sentence.

10
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:36.200
With a plural, the verb is plural too.

11
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.800
Jan has a headache. What does he say?

12
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.900
Boli mnie głowa.

13
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.460
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

14
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.860
Boli mnie głowa.

15
00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:00.300
The doctor asks since when. What does she say?

16
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.000
Od kiedy?

17
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.560
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

18
00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:11.560
Od kiedy?

19
00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:17.200
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
